{"4919670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LOOP SYNDROME", "steam_appid": 4919670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4993260], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There are no second chances in medicine.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOOP SYNDROME</strong> is a medical suspense visual novel where you relive time to change fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minato Asakura, a young physician, suddenly gains the power to rewind time after a tragic incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A failed diagnosis.<br>A life that couldn't be saved.<br>A single wrong decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always try again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or so you believe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every loop comes at a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time repeats, reality itself begins to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A suspense visual novel set in a realistic medical environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching storylines shaped by your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique loop mechanic that lets you rewrite the future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic medical scenarios created by a real physician.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, including Bad, Good, and True Endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive surgery and emergency treatment minigames.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you save every life?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake leaves a scar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no second chances in medicine.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There are no second chances in medici